    "source": "project-planner.md: Functional / Existing codebase",
    "prompt": "Plan this project using spec-brownfield.md. The existing codebase is in sample-project/. Work non-interactively: do not ask questions. Settle low-stakes gaps as assumptions. Write the phase files under phases/.",
